ion in the question. Dialysis removes dissolved solutes by diffusion down their concentration gradients across a semipermeable membrane.","B":"This choice does not fit the key distinction in the question. Dialysis removes dissolved solutes by diffusion down their concentration gradients across a semipermeable membrane.","C":"Dialysis removes dissolved solutes by diffusion down their concentration gradients across a semipermeable membrane.","D":"This choice does not fit the key distinction in the question. Dialysis removes dissolved solutes by diffusion down their concentration gradients across a semipermeable membrane."},"references":[],"review":"new_independent_provisional_answer_manual_fact_reasoning","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"57caef7a8a11e8d35b7b26f3ace4cb459e70a78c921d3e5c3cf8c81cfb73391f"},"q-565514ba9c6b":{"correct":"A","answerText":"water molecules through a membrane from a region of higher concentration of water molecules to a region of lower water molecule concentration.","explanation":"Osmosis involves net water transport across a selectively permeable membrane toward greater effective osmolarity.","optionReasons":{"A":"Osmosis involves net water transport across a selectively permeable membrane toward greater effective osmolarity.","B":"This choice does not fit the key distinction in the question. Osmosis involves net water transport across a selectively permeable membrane toward greater effective osmolarity.","C":"This choice does not fit the key distinction in the question. Osmosis involves net water transport across a selectively permeable membrane toward greater effective osmolarity.","D":"This choice does not fit the key distinction in the question. Osmosis involves net water transport across a selectively permeable membrane toward greater effective osmolarity."},"references":[],"review":"new_independent_provisional_answer_manual_fact_reasoning","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional"