ode egg coverings."},"references":[],"review":"new_curated_independent_reasoning_without_external_verification","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"8dc39203be9489fa659f8f19e0e7f6131d6ae5d6bdb55c47934a939917623d6f"},"q-e94ea21ebc68":{"correct":"C","answerText":"Echinococcus multilocularis","explanation":"Echinococcus multilocularis adults are only a few millimeters long, much smaller than adult Taenia and Dipylidium tapeworms.","optionReasons":{"C":"Echinococcus multilocularis adults are only a few millimeters long, much smaller than adult Taenia and Dipylidium tapeworms."},"references":[],"review":"new_curated_independent_reasoning_without_external_verification","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"222c176f4a0a5bfdf7ef845228474f7f9b131ea767d584f0a57c21eecb868782"},"q-a74856ade64c":{"correct":"B","answerText":"miracidium","explanation":"The ciliated miracidium hatches from the trematode egg and actively penetrates a suitable snail intermediate host.","optionReasons":{"B":"The ciliated miracidium hatches from the trematode egg and actively penetrates a suitable snail intermediate host."},"references":[],"review":"new_curated_independent_reasoning_without_external_verification","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"5bdef88ed58ed233437afaa54d08cb29552abcd4b32cd02b62393d26266b12af"},"q-0a798a6cb149":{"correct":"D","answerText":"metacercaria","explanation":"Fasciola hepatica metacercariae encyst on aquatic plants such as watercress; ingestion can initiate infection.","optionReasons":{"D":"Fasciola hepatica metacercariae encyst on aquatic plants such as watercress; ingestion can initiate infection."},"references":[],"review":"new_curated_independent_reasoning_without_external_verification","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"58ba7c7c098437c924d642030ab