 increases the weak-acid-to-conjugate-base ratio tenfold; 5:1 becomes 50:1 by the Henderson–Hasselbalch relationship.","optionReasons":{"C":"Lowering pH by one unit increases the weak-acid-to-conjugate-base ratio tenfold; 5:1 becomes 50:1 by the Henderson–Hasselbalch relationship."},"references":[],"review":"exact_duplicate_of_new_independent_answer_oct20","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"6c8bfacac3f7ad520dda46df751eb8e37a688c082e24e32b72ec6be25fe2d9a6"},"q-934b9fc1f3b8":{"correct":"D","answerText":"All of the above","explanation":"Drug targets include receptors, ion channels and transporter proteins, so all three listed categories can be drug targets.","optionReasons":{"D":"Drug targets include receptors, ion channels and transporter proteins, so all three listed categories can be drug targets."},"references":[],"review":"exact_duplicate_of_new_independent_answer_oct20","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"a5594cfe789a4dc6cba7e52e3bb6bf2daa8ec44f59ce1ea7254d5c26da45c726"},"q-5e5573692e56":{"correct":"B","answerText":"Low potency","explanation":"Tetracaine is a potent, relatively long-acting ester local anesthetic, so low potency is the incorrect description.","optionReasons":{"B":"Tetracaine is a potent, relatively long-acting ester local anesthetic, so low potency is the incorrect description."},"references":[],"review":"exact_duplicate_of_new_independent_answer_oct20","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"questionTextHash":"c347fb6fa434f8566b743890d6a0004f25648ac6d8736961dfcc7035c14fa0c9"},"q-6ec6042fc19e":{"correct":"C","answerText":"Neostigmine","explanation":"Neostigmine inhibits acetylcholinesterase and also has direct nicotinic agonist activity at the neuromuscular junction.","optionReasons":{"C":"Neostigmine inhibits acetylcholinesterase and also has direct nicotinic agonist activity at the neuromuscular jun